    "question": {
      ":question/problem": "![](images/9e/9e905d98eafd51cd455811dc9b84fbca74f45dedb7fd7363e9dd97c953b3170a.png)\n\nThe circle above is centered at $C(-1, 2)$ and the point $X(2, 3)$ lies on the circumference. Find the equation of the circle.",
